{"id":8811874,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/7996","number":7996,"state":"merged","title":"fix: BSH PFA GS1 Merge LSE 输出格式对齐 — dstStride散列 + sOuterOffset修正","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/7996","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/7996/issues","body":"## 描述\nBSH/PFA GS1 合轴场景下，UB 侧 GS1 排列与 LSE 输出偏移公式不一致，导致输出错位。\n\nBSH 与 BSND 等价，UB 均为 GS1 排列，输出均需 BNS1 格式。原代码存在两个问题：\n1. PFA GS1 Merge 仅覆盖 TND，BSH 落入直拷贝路径，缺少 GS1→BNS1 的 dstStride 散列\n2. CalcAIVSoftmaxLseOffset 对 BSH PFA 直接使用 sOuterOffset（GS1 平面索引），未除以 gSize 转换为 BNS1 的 S1 位置\n\n### 改动点\n1. **SoftmaxLseCopyOut**：PFA GS1 Merge 统一覆盖 TND 与 BSH，`if constexpr` 编译期区分\n   - BSH：`dstStride = sizeof(float) * (s1Size - 1)`，UB GS1 逐行散列为 BNS1 输出\n   - TND：`dstStride = 0`，保持 GS1 直出\n2. **CalcAIVSoftmaxLseOffset**：BSH PFA `sOuterOffset` 改为 `sOuterOffset / gSize`；TND 条件扩展为 LAYOUT_TND || LAYOUT_NTD\n\n## 关联的Issue\n从 master 分支同步，原始 PR: https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/7976\n\n## 测试\nBSH 布局 S1=4 G=4 S2=4 N1=4 N2=1 场景 LSE 输出与 golden 对齐验证\n\n## 文档更新\n无\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug修复\n- [x] ♻️ 重构","assignees_number":0,"assignees":[],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[],"labels":[{"id":4929,"color":"#2865E0","name":"cann-cla/yes","repository_id":7673863,"created_at":"2025-06-21T10:53:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T14:59:47+08:00"},{"id":3881,"color":"#555353","name":"stat/needs-squash","repository_id":7673863,"created_at":"2025-06-10T14:17:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:42:03+08:00"},{"id":3873,"color":"#21BA45","name":"ci-pipeline-passed","repository_id":7673863,"created_at":"2025-06-10T14:17:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T19:51:29+08:00"},{"id":2742,"color":"#22ed07","name":"approved","repository_id":7673863,"created_at":"2025-05-29T20:14:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T21:56:14+08:00"},{"id":2741,"color":"#17f207","name":"lgtm","repository_id":7673863,"created_at":"2025-05-29T20:14